@startuml
actor Analyst as A
participant "SIEM" as SIEM
participant "IAM SOAR" as SOAR
participant "IdP" as IDP
participant "PAM/JIT" as PAM
participant "Service Owner" as OWNER
participant "Incident Commander" as IC

A -> SIEM: Triage high-risk IAM alert
SIEM -> SOAR: Trigger identity incident playbook
SOAR -> IDP: Pull token/session metadata
SOAR -> PAM: Validate privileged session grants
SOAR -> A: Evidence package + blast radius
A -> IC: Declare incident severity
IC -> OWNER: Request business impact assessment
IC -> SOAR: Authorize containment
SOAR -> IDP: Revoke refresh/session tokens
SOAR -> PAM: Suspend active privileged elevation
SOAR -> SIEM: Increase telemetry sampling
A -> IC: Confirm containment effectiveness
IC -> OWNER: Approve staged recovery
OWNER -> IDP: Re-enable constrained access
SOAR -> SIEM: Close incident + lessons learned tasks
@enduml
